title: "Septic shock prediction: design effects in MIMIC-IV and eICU-CRD"
abstract: >-
  Code for the manuscript "Predictor timing, outcome overlap and lead time shape
  apparent septic-shock prediction performance: a controlled analysis in MIMIC-IV
  and eICU-CRD". No patient-level data, predictions or trained models are included.
